  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environ archaeology 04-08 - Environment archaeology</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xF6;arkeologi 2004-2008</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program support to the regional research network African Archaeology Network. Focus on environmental archaeology. Includes support for research projects, postgraduate program, courses and regional networking. The Archaeology Unit at the University of Dar es Salaam is host institution for the network, which includes 11 countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xF6;d till det regionala forskningsn&#xE4;tverket African Archaeology Network. Fokus p&#xE5; environmental archaeology. Inkluderar st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r forskningsprojekt, forskarutbildningsprogram, kurser och regionalt n&#xE4;tverkande. Arkeologienheten vid University of Dar es Salaam &#xE4;r v&#xE4;rdinstitution f&#xF6;r n&#xE4;tverket, som inkluderar 11 l&#xE4;nder.</narrative>
  </description>
